# Keep the working tree LF everywhere. The build reads sources with javac/aapt2, both
# line-ending agnostic, but a checkout that silently rewrites every file to CRLF makes
# "does my clone match the repo?" needlessly hard to answer.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these: a text filter on a binary corrupts it.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
